Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:23:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 17/17] gestures: add a three finger swipe screenshot toggle

there was no way to take a screenshot with a touchscreen gesture.

add a switch under gestures that writes the three_finger_screenshot
secure setting read by phonewindowmanager. off by default.
